   "sources": [
    "world/sources/lore/topics/fauna-hazards.md (Mud: Helstrom's Heart-Mud is pitch black and the region's defining substance; the black river mud is 'a thick gluey paste' that holds a standing man's feet fast)",
    "world/sources/lore/regions/middle-argonia.md:11 (Helstrom Heart-Mud, pitch black)",
    "docs/decisions/0157-the-marsh-does-what-the-lore-says.md ruling 11"
   ],
   "notes": "Terrain ground only, never a collider tag: it is the land cover `black_mud` (the ground-material id 4 of decision 0011, `landcover.py` BLACK_MUD, 'pitch black'), the one cover the lore names for Heart-Mud. Arrows and climbing read it as mud; the feet read `ground`.",
