   "ground": {
    "landCover": [
     "black_mud"
    ],
    "speedMultiplier": 0.75,
    "sprintAllowed": false,
    "derivation": "'Holds a standing man's feet fast': slow and sticky. Sticky is the one existing law for ground that holds the legs, the over-the-knee wade (swim.ts wadeTopSpeed, owner ruling 16x): no sprint. Slow is one gait step: PLAYER_WALK_SPEED / PLAYER_SPRINT_SPEED = 5.3 / 7.1 = 0.7465 (Skyrim MOVT, io/input.ts), held at the round 0.75 of every ground speed (within 1%), so a walk is 3.975 m/s and a held sprint (refused) can reach no more than the walk."
   }
